    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dive into post-apocalyptic vibes. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience survival challenges. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Explore fantasy realms. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Dive into a sci-fi universe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Step into CYBER INTERNET CLUB SIMULATOR where you\u2019re not just a manager but the visionary behind the trendiest cyber hotspot in town!<br><br>Will you outwit ruthless hackers and sly competitors to safeguard your digital empire from hacking and theft? Dive into the challenge of constructing, fortifying, and dominating in this electrifying cyber simulation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.poster.avif?t=1732528907\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.webm?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.mp4?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From modest beginnings, embark on an epic quest to elevate your basic setup into the ultimate cyber sanctuary. But be warned, success doesn\u2019t come effortlessly! Harness your strategic acumen to manage resources efficiently, make astute investments, and maintain a steady cash flow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.poster.avif?t=1732528907\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.webm?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.mp4?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Numbers serve as the groundwork, yet customization reigns supreme! Tailor your club from top to bottom with an array of styles and themes. Whether your taste leans toward sleek futurism or nostalgic retro vibes, the choice is yours. Experiment with color palettes, layout configurations, and embellishments to cultivate an ambiance as distinctive as your clientele.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/fb550ee1037fe59169ebe18a0e9d6821.poster.avif?t=1732528907\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/fb550ee1037fe59169ebe18a0e9d6821.webm?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/fb550ee1037fe59169ebe18a0e9d6821.mp4?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Naturally, no cyber internet club is complete without the latest tech gadgets! Keep ahead of the curve by consistently upgrading your array of gaming PCs, VR rigs, and state-of-the-art electronics. With each innovative addition, you\u2019ll attract a broader audience of tech enthusiasts eager to indulge in the next big innovation.<br><br>But it\u2019s not merely about flashy features - customer satisfaction reigns supreme. Pay heed to feedback, adapt your approach, and witness your reputation skyrocket. After all, delighted customers translate to loyal patrons!<br><br>Are you prepared to construct the cyber internet club of your fantasies? Take the helm as manager and embark on a thrilling voyage to cyber dominance in Cyber internet club Simulator!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Step into CYBER INTERNET CLUB SIMULATOR where you\u2019re not just a manager but the visionary behind the trendiest cyber hotspot in town!<br><br>Will you outwit ruthless hackers and sly competitors to safeguard your digital empire from hacking and theft? Dive into the challenge of constructing, fortifying, and dominating in this electrifying cyber simulation!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.poster.avif?t=1732528907\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.webm?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/650fca345bf51a8117d9e5b813ed902c.mp4?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>From modest beginnings, embark on an epic quest to elevate your basic setup into the ultimate cyber sanctuary. But be warned, success doesn\u2019t come effortlessly! Harness your strategic acumen to manage resources efficiently, make astute investments, and maintain a steady cash flow.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.poster.avif?t=1732528907\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.webm?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845070/extras/39632eba7c6d616b6ecaa88656d55f48.mp4?t=1732528907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Numbers serve as the groundwork, yet customization 